      plain_english = "Four towering fortress monoliths lock cyan laser beams onto the central logic crystal. Each tower is a completely separate, tiny verifier program written from scratch. The 6 small amber gems in front are the ONLY 6 helper scripts in the entire 17M-line repo — all audited by human experts.",
